    title: "Python emits only 'private' modifier; other languages only emit positive visibility (asymmetric)"  # e2b5
    status: violated  # e2b5
    priority: 2  # e2b5
    parent:  # e2b5
    tags:  # e2b5
    - dogfooding  # e2b5
